# The cases of faults_text.anti: a name and the value of ANTI_FAULT, see
# tests/CMakeLists.txt. alloc counts the memory of the runtime after the
# start: the path of remove is the fifth, the kept message of its error
# the sixth, the copy of to_bytes the seventh, the room of the builder the
# eighth and the byte of the empty builder the ninth.
path_memory alloc:5:ENOMEM
kept_memory alloc:6:ENOMEM
copy_memory alloc:7:ENOMEM
builder_memory alloc:8:ENOMEM
take_memory alloc:9:ENOMEM
